<title>USA: Trilon Dominion group cuts UTILX stake.</title>
<headline>Trilon Dominion group cuts UTILX stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Trilon Dominion Partners LLC and Dominion Resources Inc said Friday it reduced its stake in UTILX Corp to 4.34 percent, or 311,565 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it sold 115,000 shares of UTILX between July 31 and August 29 at prices ranging from $3.50 to $3.88 a share, or a total of $425,400.</p>
<p>The group said it previously held a 5.937 percent stake, or 426,565 shares in UTILX.</p>
</text>
